{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08464","headline":"灞陵行送别 · 李白","name":"灞陵行送别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"送君灞陵亭，灞水流浩浩。\n上有无花之古树，下有伤心之春草。\n我向秦人问路岐，云是王粲南登之古道。\n古道连绵走西京，紫阙落日浮云生。\n正当今夕断肠处，黄鹂愁绝不忍听。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08464.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08464","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"黄宗壤"}